<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Resolver Application Review</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f7f7f7;
        color: #333;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 500px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background: #fff;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .highlight {
        color: #1d4ed8;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #888;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Your Resolver Application Is Under Review</h2>
      <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
      <p>
        Thank you for applying to become a resolver with us. We appreciate the
        time and effort you invested in submitting your application.
      </p>
      <p>
        Your application is currently being reviewed by our team. We are
        carefully assessing each submission, and we will get to yours shortly.
      </p>
      <p>
        We appreciate your patience and understanding while we complete the
        review process. We will be in touch as soon as a decision has been made.
      </p>
      <p>Thank you again for your interest in joining our team.</p>
      <p>
        Best regards,<br />
        <span class="highlight">City Sense Team</span>
      </p>
      <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> City Sense. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
